(2. Mirror Walk \(Cryptography\)) Tj
T*
(Flag: ZeroSecure_CTF{mirror_and_shift}) Tj
T*
(Files: index.html, note.txt, cipher.txt) Tj
T*
(Detailed solve path:) Tj
T*
(Read note.txt. It says: Three steps forward. Then stand in front of the mirror. What comes) Tj
T*
(back is the message.) Tj
T*
(The intended interpretation is Caesar shift by 3 and then Atbash mirror.) Tj
T*
(Take the ciphertext from cipher.txt: XsfiEsucfs_UDR{koffif_wjt_epord}) Tj
T*
(Apply the mirror first and then shift back by 3, or equivalently shift forward by 3 and then) Tj
T*
(mirror. The decoded result is ZeroSecure_CTF{mirror_and_shift}.) Tj
T*
(A quick verified route is Atbash\(ciphertext\) => ChurVhfxuh_FWI{pluuru_dqg_vkliw}, then Caesar) Tj
T*
(shift -3 => ZeroSecure_CTF{mirror_and_shift}.) Tj
T*
() Tj
