(4. Tiny Gate \(Reverse Engineering\)) Tj
T*
(Flag: ZeroSecure_CTF{mirror_then_xor}) Tj
T*
(Files: gate.py) Tj
T*
(Detailed solve path:) Tj
T*
(Read gate.py. The encode function reverses the candidate string, then for each byte adds i +) Tj
T*
(3, XORs the result with 0x2A, and compares against TARGET.) Tj
T*
(To solve it, reverse the transformation instead of brute forcing it.) Tj
T*
(For each TARGET byte at index i, compute \(\(byte XOR 0x2A\) - i - 3\) & 0xFF.) Tj
T*
(Convert the recovered byte list to text and reverse the full string at the end.) Tj
T*
(That produces ZeroSecure_CTF{mirror_then_xor}.) Tj
T*
() Tj
